{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "End ban on new licences for exploratory offshore oil and gas drilling\r\n",
        "additional_details": "Grant new oil and gas exploration licences and renegotiate current licences that are due to expire with a view to maximising revenue generation & forming lucrative long-term contracts to maximise the profitability of UK businesses.\r\n \r\nAll tax gained from what we believe will be a new windfall should be used exclusively to reduce fuel duties and VAT, on petrol, diesel, gas, electric and aviation fuel, to unleash our industrial might for all from business to households.",
        "background": "End the ban on new licences for oil and gas exploration and seek to renegotiate any current licences due to expire in order to maximise tax revenue generation and growth for UK business and households.",
